{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/bubble

    What a character says: its initial (its picture, later), its name and its words.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * initial - the first letter of its name, while it has no picture
    * role - memory or herald
    * name - the character's name
    * text - what it says
    * figure - Gaudí's drawing of it whole, in a pose, or nothing

    Example context (json):
    {
        "initial": "M",
        "role": "memory",
        "name": "Memoria",
        "text": "He buscado por toda la biblioteca.",
        "figure": null, "portrait": null
    }
}}
<div class="ayv-bubble{{#figure}} ayv-bubble-posed{{/figure}}">
    {{#figure}}<span class="ayv-figure"><img class="ayv-bubble-figure" src="{{figure}}" alt="" width="512" height="512"></span>{{/figure}}
    {{^figure}}<span class="ayv-bubble-portrait ayv-bubble-{{role}}" aria-hidden="true">{{#portrait}}<img class="ayv-bubble-img" src="{{portrait}}" alt="">{{/portrait}}{{^portrait}}{{initial}}{{/portrait}}</span>{{/figure}}
    <p class="ayv-bubble-text"><span class="ayv-bubble-name">{{name}}</span> {{text}}{{#listen}} {{> local_oksigeniaayvurenda/listen}}{{/listen}}</p>
</div>
